ass=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/parlament\">Парламент</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво обещаха правителствата и какво стана\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/obeshtaniya\">Обещания</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Вярно ли е казаното, корупционни дела\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/proverki\">Проверки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Приходи, разходи, дълг\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/byudzhet\">Бюджет</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Договори, фирми, риск, връзки с политици\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/porachki\">Поръчки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Растеж, инфлация, заплати, жилища\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ikonomika\">Икономика</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Цените в магазините по вериги и места\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ceni\">Цени</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Вашата община: пари, поръчки, съвет\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/mesta\">Места</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Състояние на данните</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Данните се обновяват автоматично по график. Тук се вижда, направо от системата за автоматизация (GitHub Actions), кога всеки източник е обновен за последно. Ако някой закъснява, получаваме известие. <a href=\"/metodologiya#avtomatichno\">Кое е автоматично и кое пишат хора</a>.</div></div></div><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Парламент, депутати, бюджет, евросредства, местна власт</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">всеки ден сутрин; ср–пт и вечер</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Програма на парламента</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">3 пъти на ден</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Законопроекти: мотиви, доклади, становища, дебати</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">всяка нощ</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Стенограми и сверка на числата</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">всяка нощ</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Обществени поръчки и анекси (ЦАИС ЕОП)</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">на всеки 3 часа</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Сигнали от обявленията (срокове, промени)</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">всяка нощ</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Търговски регистър</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">на всеки 2 часа</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Решения на общинските съвети</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">на всеки 4 часа</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Цени в магазините</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">всеки ден</span></div></li><li class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-surface text-muted\">Проверява се…</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Статистики (Евростат, НСИ)</span><span class=\"text-sm text-muted\">всеки вторник</span></div></li></ul><p class=\"text-sm text-muted mt-6\">„Успешно“ значи, че източникът е прочетен. Ако институцията не е публикувала нищо ново, данните остават същите. Плащанията от СЕБРА засега се обновяват на ръка, докато порталът за отворени данни разреши автоматичен достъп.</p></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"bg-surface border-t border-rule mt-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 text-sm text-muted grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\"><p>Не подкрепяме партия, кандидат или правителство. Всяко число има източник и дата.<!-- --> <a href=\"/metodologiya\">Как работим</a> · <a href=\"/rechnik\">Речник</a> · <a href=\"/sastoyanie\">Състояние на данните</a> · <!--$--><a href=\"https://github.com/osaznatost/osaznatost-web/issues/new?labels=%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0&amp;title=%D0%93%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0%20%D0%BD%D0%B0%20%2Fsastoyanie&amp;body=%D0%A1%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B0%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fosaznatost-web.vercel.app%2Fsastoyanie%0A%0A%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%20%D0%B5%20%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%88%D0%BD%D0%BE%3A%0A%0A%D0%9A%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%20%D1%82%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%B1%D0%B2%D0%B0%20%D0%B4%D0%B0%20%D0%BF%D0%B8%D1%88%D0%B5%20(%D0%B8%20%D0%B8%D0%B7%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%2C%20%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%20%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5)%3A%0A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Съобщи за грешка</a><!--/$--></p><p class=\"sm:text-right\">Вътрешен прототип · данните са към датите, посочени до тях</p></div></footer><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\",\"static/chunks/2vy51v46dlsq-.js\",\"static/chunks/2bx7ggprk0oi5.js\",\"static/chunks/0c1ad7rcpjghx.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><header class=\"bg-deep text-white border-b border-white/10 sticky top-0 z-40 lg:static\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 flex items-center gap-x-8 h-14 lg:h-auto lg:py-4\"><a class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block w-3 h-